{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1245,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1582d35bdefae70846f05dcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呵呵♪这季节充满\r\n我喜欢的大型比赛呢～\r\n我连一场都不会错过喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "675d72700a0c1720978bf86f1d967361c06d1b3f20bb71f5b8dcdfc96e09b614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5ee19f3a93bc1b859f8edd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有些活动的事需要你\r\n帮我一点忙……你对体力\r\n有自信吗？很耐热吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8f115a9743d326febb9bb3b571faa608d48cd28b553c333ca649c728ead7da5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26cb226cee81bdf41a1186a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大型比赛也很赞，\r\n但我很在意出道战的结果耶～\r\n今年到底是什么人胜出？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa759030b0f160607a986380efe112272fdab9af9f863a770a6257b157fa588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2cbd9118ba84e2352a5527b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，刚才戴着柔软面罩的\r\n赛马娘……毛茸茸的……\r\n真是太可爱……我不行了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "12c701f9a127ea19133d1b9d412f8692083ac654d527234fede50d516bdad81e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e077d99b6c42936abfc19517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差点跌倒的怒涛，\r\n跟有如跳舞般出手相助的好歌剧……\r\n啊啊……谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62919989b616852cc4c4e8b1f36f3eff4d1938c534ef04491a81039b9b65b865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0763f58dcc5bf07779a9cb7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳跟善信两位散发的阳气，\r\n对我来说太过刺激了……！\r\n可是我好喜翻……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87f96afd8ea5700a8879f71e6a6692d58e5dae78626161f54e492595890d1cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:129e4436efe9f5ff9695d2a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "历奇看到殭尸时反应很大……\r\n还说要为我开办一对一风水讲座……\r\n蛤？根本天使吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c253479ffb5c15f089091b198425bd67808e528a21f2043ee0bba28496e85de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2fa94d6acbccc35d974b49e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被尊到倒下，再被尊到复活……\r\n我们这些阿宅，\r\n或许生来就是殭尸也说不定呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "08813be580d434df27dd183445e51f7aa785af564b2cbe8d7a9c9796dbac65d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64811ed80a190e4444b4a2bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目前速子正在研究如何重现\r\n殭尸如钢铁般强韧的肉体。\r\n她那认真的神情我好喜翻……",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b2c7913b9e0bbb175e34d081c156250f42a0847fcb1085ae7f0c49505549e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd318c9037ce3c8c28e4f8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨是很多怪物的弱点……然而！\r\n阿宅殭尸不能就此倒下！\r\n上学的景色、晨跑……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c505c1dfbcfd573e91afcc8b26b0e9948454644db06e330e92ff7af8fe054692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23948c1561ed689043f16dff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在大白天穿着这身打扮\r\n会非常显眼……无法藏身于\r\n背景之中了！大危机！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c13e759702cb704e2beda06ac4de0812ec56d64d991293e660582648e906100",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c38cba79981c3aeb6ec38fe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了夜晚在外面行走时不去吓到\r\n赛马娘们，我都非常小心谨慎！\r\n绝对不能造成困扰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d309b64112f0e1d3b3359e2dac4e11a07c25051f0d354ac35d65ac47c475f035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df46ea2d860ccd58c552c675",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承蒙赛马娘亲口称赞「这套衣服\r\n好有春天气息！」……呜，采用\r\n大面积粉红色实在太好了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d2c85c8b7ccf13a425dc3e868f2e1d52f27bd862d06c5bdfa8636109c457f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70cded791bae03bf12ed487f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿成这样我也不热喔～\r\n想知道我这经历过无数战场的勇者\r\n都是如何预防中暑的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7d7553ee043156a53b86900ef05e8430d2bc2d6c7db8060b3e330791460c438",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:478e73de5d89fb6089b366fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不必给我点心没关系！我只想阅读\r\n你那充满赛马娘之爱的作品！\r\n可以跟我交换吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc95bd654e38062d1d3a30dfa3787828b49208a80391b21e41fec638c205f47d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:882f71006dc1307d61e07c07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说殭尸会从嘴巴吐出寒气……\r\n如果不要一次吐太多，不就能尽情\r\n欣赏赛马娘们互相依偎的景色了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "43764149c2044ea1ca0127795c679b92c9c2bf2f8cb6d4414ad36a2c3448988c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db48cd0e7424b95221d8d791",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的推都对这个猫熊布贴\r\n赞不绝口……我好庆幸自己有\r\n制作周边的能力啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1ac1542f1fbd1ea330325e7799aced50e5a75434fc6ae657e85ad1bda9c50af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8013609b72f4794bc7889e5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我原先很烦恼该注重恐怖还是\r\n可爱……最后决定打造一个因为\r\n对赛马娘的爱而迷失自我的怪物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee3163a712bca216d4457d37ed6d4f84c273f872ec6722dc9c35e58232fe19e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52e602f018cd19102643ec71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，想怎么训练就照做吧！\r\n我会尽全力完成的喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ec5595c0601c5abc97106f8f7939acf02e825a5eebf51181b27c5c4ba40050f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b220ed6d6c3033e6c3ad3cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るぞー☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7dd06046cf1e8ad84a1afc5546f403c10f2ce77811987d52a2bd31d1a5ebe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:858b0eeb3708df02fd04ad6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个要这样子，这个要那样子……\r\n唔呵呵，假想训练无懈可击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34bd87861bb3bd27bd30c5d8e20a5749d2a549d8b9124a7113d73b2fd73f2de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ccf4e36340eefa1b020fe90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，今天我的推也很尊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7b1f1d852f46e023e41e4780a16e6f12e60265b1b306b656470a8b90f19b71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f586ecaeb54af0c912a78087",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一想到究竟有多少赛马娘\r\n曾经通过这里……\r\n──真让人受不了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b56ae0fa4fc969b299ee16818a8843bf11a3a214b060698e5764ba83419791f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16ae0facc81070d92988f02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "古代的哲学家有云：\r\n「所谓的爱，比起被爱，\r\n更该去爱人」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "160b28f7a0d76738a7198829783d7f3453ccddf0cd4df058f954a1676030b9c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9137805e5eeda1e251c81304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「仰之弥高，\r\n钻之弥坚」──\r\n……赛马娘也是这样呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea197a471bf81eb493ce0da5b3a471b8fea5d88227cae4a2758003c014b15cfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda107ca6517defad58e078a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「如果推了右边的女孩，左边的也要\r\n一起推。」古代的伟人是这么说的！\r\n来吧！我已有决心要支持所有人了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98df5919fd6abd108661cc2a178eea686ea8446bbf0a494f5b8c8e0b9eb12d52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de313ad3539f19e683dd3b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇……！！\r\n有一堆穿泳装的赛马娘……！！\r\n活着真好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b8e713d1551f88ad48371272bb7bf9322c2fed90e084e7c77c9a9e8318615d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f9e2fc7fc7e9cf4f40902c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同志……志同道合的道士。\r\n对我下命令吧。\r\n本殭尸会听从你的所有命令！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef040c9b4b3d9f2fe828ced291a9bddb67c71d828c743f049da116eb571609f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63dc4a703273533e0721d193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仔细想想，\r\n两手高举在前方跳跃前进，\r\n这运动量满大的呢～呼～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28f7b351244e892d07b3650e40e84ceca2953ac27cf9f06724cca05bed28237",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48841644922ee8263f6b89a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "汗水淋漓挥洒青春的赛马娘！\r\n一想到这种画面\r\n就会忍不住兴奋地蹦蹦跳啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d64eea9c415751f7f73464ae8cf415fd1a1e7bf11ebcbcbe4faede5b6478946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad1b394d5f12fc05057e7b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身怀怪力、身手矫捷，并同时拥有\r\n一颗炙热之心的阿宅殭尸是\r\n毫无死角的！尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcb9aea401ee4b75d3aef78ec2d35be873f536109bc23c3949682b88ac047581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:338fd356d783f5d0ef7bceef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问～你对角色扮演有兴趣吗……\r\n没有啦，其实要我独自参加\r\n也是可以啦～也是可以啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6e0806d849bae17cd43d4f9f7fff57e4834254933a83c3a7aac60314e905ba2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:782f0891e0355a9f3f98f9df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道士，我相信你，这些符咒\r\n就交给你了……我开始失控时\r\n请立刻封印住我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbbe1f3b66f24ddf67cbd3f48094825dea0ef217e81d8ced54f060838f040f4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2517812101d44fea4ca5fdef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有同志才能与我共享\r\n并控制这狂野的灵魂！\r\n今天也卯足全力加油吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7021ee66477d9e53cff8b419943a7d90fb5f56e1750dd93e64ece33a50d62be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec445ca0a4f1bfe0423a8fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你才是赛马娘大师！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c29aac99d49d41e5ea33f8af9c5fae8ecc98c59cc2b4e44c048183830b34ff31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb43be91a14b79f310244aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是段非常密集又充实的时光～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaef34eeae6acadf361d97afd76e6593b0cefb1f008cf8a42286ca586f800d91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a46cc9fceb8005f81b8fab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道士与阿宅殭尸！根本最佳拍檔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac346be845a2d443e9b465fae56a8c0e7d04d4d1694e59423051fe2196f295d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b42ca9c5884dbd36dc6d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢……！万分感谢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1c169d1f5a21c67971e68611b61fbf248a2da1dfd21ce0c063841c5e5428b5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b1f7e67a4030f734dd52103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等级要提升了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b35bc605ac3828dec1183bfae73017302599ce6df38aa7bd85991338b417e56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec93059371b72a2958ed328",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是为了我的推！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df0ad6721d75c0cd825edb03dd6706ab80b4b336544d73b199d3d73b4dd71b7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:115dd8302139e242db1748c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是的，我是爱丽数码！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7e077841cc0927c36062aa5a024a6b8ad7e0011f77229aa9769603ee539e10b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:155810040fe04b8f4c2bb8de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是为了感受我的推，\r\n不管要跑过草地还是沙土都愿意！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5921faa580f0367d68d282c3734ddd2f22ead0be59644f8c7443cc9c0dad86dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a401cbff7bdafa89afdf7daa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会追好追满的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a7b9289248b4f081527322b8d868f6bd3f55ed3e07351bb916569513fcbda3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d12b4241002b16d440161aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会好好服侍的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb5261ea824818c6724f4be330196bf58c5baedd0c4cb6a5af8c4ac63b93f30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ccc85179e37ef2879503ce9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "注意注意！失控殭尸来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43df087b90221b0b2bbef181a505a6febc59337bdf55d38599b3218f7e5e5bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b36c5070b93930d40f28dc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "数码殭尸大飞翔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e2c29d1d3d9acb70d5c134de3af58f39afdf92ceeb908c221bd5b350ab0c86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75ff1c94676ed1de998ff6ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论被尊倒几次，我都会\r\n为了尊而……再度复活──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62191b742fa24aaf3f4394da9dd56e138605a203325ab60920b95cdb3110da29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df8bf53e01f529428751620b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱丽数码复活啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "758d4c4ca76f7291b6b185726332f7a8383e6abc0746e9e519dbcc1a0284a8a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5b6adbbe93f453f4a48614",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我就去咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96441a321db55e3e5b8eb19cf1f36a61d6fc16261e9eb4346e00b1bdd3cd9e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836ae4df1a57e104ef0619ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然决定要钓了，\r\n那就钓大鱼吧，最大的那种。\r\n这样也比较有意思嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c1ff64773b70f9fc3118953b47ee86245c3dd99459f7363b46238fef723a1f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f3f6333546c0dd479b850c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるねー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee521eef403f19f620057c21ef2e5d94147fc9b6b010860e533cd825bba3765d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eff10bd4755cc3ceb459614",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f1034fda5c4ecc869695659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出门去哪晃晃好像也不错——\r\n别担心——我不会做坏事的，\r\n坏事是不会做啦……你懂吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "76927fa2fe49587f8246346ad1aaa886d4f42a749d448f4cc8f6f32d6278e5d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2ae991705561839dbdfe528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，青酱的好感度似乎……？\r\n登登登……噗噗——很遗憾。\r\n才不会这么简单就提升嘞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9f2251111f9f53e62345adba91132c55361776cfbf7465abe00b49dd69e3752",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f2b72b74974d56a170d1869",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐——今年也多多指教了……\r\n是说那个“红”字开头的东西，\r\n你什么时候才要给我啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c2a5b8dfe90758b0a326f9c89dc5bbf1426d63e4a15a9b2c3164ee4f647cd3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c17f887628f87234175841e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊——情人节哦——\r\n没有巧克力，鱼倒是有钓到几条——\r\n等下送给你，要吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a51c54638b116fa4765d7d332c07099a9503a41253fccb2a0a03307719f205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:549cc7255669b41bd0cf927c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，\r\n其实我是有准备训练员的巧克力啦。\r\n呵呵呵——怎么办好嘞——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a24d8fc2079749dc079a47bcad25718280d924a00cce2feda0c53321f0965cae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c4d96f49f5ca5937f662f26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是写在签纸上哪会实现愿望啊！\r\n所以……训练员啊，\r\n我想要新的钓竿耶——",
      "source_fingerprint": "da22eb7ced39b8dbd1d5d8980d1105ae8eae115037a55d887fcf88a8f6e21214",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff7f679b594cf7fddc451c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给我糖果吧！\r\n……嗯？我没有要恶作剧啊。\r\n恶作剧太麻烦了嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1db4b3e73c62873dea0942a93fd330b50f25fc6fc81f54abf5a01e2e07b0790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4151ff41c5f1249e5051b746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得圣诞老人不来也没关系，\r\n可是我想要礼物，\r\n人家就是这种年纪嘛——偷瞄——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d0c384a4f7f2a2c4e04f350e2ec926d7378a22e9f95d97249b62f104f21a2ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e1c4f4130690e1b4f29e83f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔要不要也顺应潮流一下，\r\n准备炸鸡和披萨来办派对啊？\r\n用训练员的钱来买，耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37a20a42f245ecac075d0e90839a883ba5b9cec07577e1e93193c0414f578a83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac8fa781542cf967aff4c74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶——♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b809ede7285680868664420c54e3cb41a8fd3c5db0040b750491355c4902ccc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7b10bd102f0e5a8e9f730a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉……好不想写贺年卡哦——\r\n但如果不写的话，\r\n妈妈又会很啰嗦……唉——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad0dd0497c1c7aff1fec657f37c7af455625d4a55034a317e1d580e129d4f65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc3eede04aa62deeed228b41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯～今天是什么日子来着？\r\n开玩笑的啦，我有准备好不好。\r\n准备了祝贺生日的吉祥话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af22d34a4307b8f5ccf3e27270b4efa283aed6dff032e32bc141dd251d58a05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49123b0cd0ebd2c621624c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……生日快乐。\r\n呵呵，我决定尝试这样直接祝贺。\r\n怎么样？有觉得开心吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5601b2918e49d20239a6fa81d5d39f24fb2e019cee5bd55d7ed5c51201b593d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeb6d7af120b92b09d800677",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是我的生日礼物的话，\r\n我可是随时都准备好要收下的哦！\r\n全年无休，都收——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f81f98088e51b3c6fd6fb9f9613cc3809dac0232b3295c937fa6851dc2fbe9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45b8a5b983f116ab9ee5af37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，不管怎么说……\r\n有人记得自己生日还是满开心的。\r\n感谢感谢——",
      "source_fingerprint": "399e8fd1994946324a7af1d442d0a691ffa3afca3f208e1dce78054f6c4f722b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18e2552b648fe87ae8db39ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐——呐——\r\n好像有什么新公告\r\n是寄来给训练员你的耶——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec90111e3856ca9cdfc9de3cf200ae7569acc26f02bc0c1578150d4b53ef13e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6936fc22e952e0fea1c94aa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来你好像收到了不错的东西嘛——\r\n也分给我一些啦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad5353de3add551571f8f771d52fb48fc6cb5cc97e0410fdb570ed254d9d9e42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00803f7793549944fc2fe979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭喜你达成任务——\r\n哎哟，工作能力很强嘛！了不起！\r\n我的作业也请你拿去做吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a260b215c3a6ebccd5b84eed7d39798b41a2d8603ea3dbda2508c703050be890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eeedf0f350885628d17259d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说快要有活动了耶。\r\n那么——会不会发生什么\r\n有趣的事呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f5b81cbc73a5f040ec3d8aa2c97b47af5ce214f5c7a60429d128f3a2e75d1d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bf976ace1c4b6b4232855c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动……也就是说，\r\n这是观察大家实力的好机会……\r\n也说不定？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eac6c481dfede0f4dd43dbbffd6430d750a4944f08163c235bce79f0d2b8a07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a59f7d9e07c8f9c852f747ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aedc8b8baf5f19ab05df840fc32b5ff2fc89be8fce34b7ff86ce6b67ba602a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c7e4660a27a4e220db6262",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级好像提升了耶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e22a045a59707f563758187d6ae415440da0a7083bec1613ac0aa834af487c7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4f3e154e7c48f3f9b7d5d01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吊带裤虽然看起来很轻松随意，\r\n但听说原本是一种工作服喔。\r\n虽然说我根本不打算勤奋工作啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d32275bf2b26dffb223fc82a5dfb60d4366c379473078a34d1b804ba616f770",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72f5ad90b9360ef7e3fa6717",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放下单肩吊带是我的穿搭讲究……\r\n话是这么说，但契机只是源自\r\n某次睡迷糊忘记把两边都穿好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8369d3ecb6c7e4beb7ef97486379c91806f6304eddd09cd3e5f9e7e8c8a442ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4435d4ee81dd6ecfdf2777f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次我午睡到一半\r\n有只猫咪钻进衣裤间的缝隙～\r\n没想到宽松的衣服还有这种好处……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d178dd67dbc6e6ace5f0f72abcad31b6b2a569baa3b6fdd31fe8609c101a8f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8787802df61d6533e838a73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大概就是这样吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac452f2c649da8e0ac1dc7c0809b97bb094ad464bfb1bde9f56cf1138179905b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f84f5963fe56c4852fdc166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔～成功了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3bf868d78de74ad80f499181b3203a5e19c47a734f7d4c26aa7cf71d6ddd45c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63102fe2d3902a88e49a4b6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aedc8b8baf5f19ab05df840fc32b5ff2fc89be8fce34b7ff86ce6b67ba602a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "1005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
